aragraph","text":"本日、10月23日発売の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『アップトゥボーイvol.296』様に掲載させていただいています✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アップトゥボーイさんを拝見していて、透明感があふれる美しいお写真にいつも魅了され心から憧れておりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温かい日差しの中で撮影していただき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「こんな風に撮れてるよ☺︎」と教えてくださったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しいお声掛けをいただいたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温かい皆様とご一緒させていただいて本当に幸せな1日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと頑張ろうと改めて思いました。✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アップトゥボーイさんに撮影をしていただけて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤純奈さんと一緒の号に掲載させていただけて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心からありがたく嬉しい気持ちでいっぱいです✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非よろしくお願い致します( *ˊᵕˋ ) ⁾⁾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------- ｷﾘｶｴ ---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「熱闘！Mリーグ」さんに出演させていただきました✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/_pre/blog/newfourth/img/2020/10/23/3821255/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"麻雀は、最近アプリをインストールして挑戦し始めました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく楽しくて時間が過ぎるのがものすごく早く感じてしまいます\\(ᯅ̈ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Mリーグさんや、中田花奈さんがご出演なさっている番組を拝見していて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのパターンがある中でより可能性を広げるにはどうしたら良いのか、瞬時に頭を回転させながらも相手との駆け引きを考えたりと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同時にたくさんのことを考えながら手先を美しく素早く軽やかに動かしていらっしゃる様子に、目が離せないほど心を奪われました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご一緒させていただいた皆様や『かなりんのトップ目とれるカナ？』さんを拝見していて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"麻雀を通じて皆様が優しくお話しなさっている様子に心から温かく素敵だなと思いました(*ˊᵕˋ*) ❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人で収録をさせていただく事が初めてで、緊張してしまっていた私に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご一緒させていただいた皆様がたくさんお話ししてくださったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番中も「今のわかる？」と常に教えてくださったり、数えきれぬほど助けていただいたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しく温かいお心遣いいただき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様とご一緒出来て心から有り難い気持ちでいっぱいです。✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は初歩的な事しかわからず、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アプリだと「次どうしよう...」とたくさん時間をかけて考えたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲームが教えてくださったり、覚えられている役の中でしか考えられなかったり、言葉もたくさん勉強中です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと麻雀の知識を高めて、皆さんのような温かい応援ができるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今回「熱闘！Mリーグ」さんに出演させていただけることを家族に報告した時、父と祖母が少し麻雀をした事があると知りました✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか家族で麻雀ができるように、これからも勉強したいです！( '-' )ง✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素晴らしい世界を知るきっかけをくださった中田花奈さん、本当にありがとうございます✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------- ｷﾘｶｴ ---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、黒見ちゃんです( ¨̮ )♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の美佑ちゃんブログで「何か欲しいバトンある？？」と書いてありました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えー、欲しいバトン...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ、竹筒で( ˙-˙ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくださり、ありがとうございました☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/_pre/blog/newfourth/img/2020/10/23/3821255/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんにとって、素敵な一週間になりますように...✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日もありがとうございました☺︎"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-keya-32877":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"小腹が空いたら枝豆食べてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅坂46   二期生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮崎県出身   20歳の松田里奈です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ開いていただきありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前はアイスをよく食べてたんですけどちょっと我慢しようと思って、枝豆ならヘルシーかなーと思って枝豆食べてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"枝豆おいしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1回食べだしたら止まらない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/bbb/0632f4ca13b6a26270c6e1e646323.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「僕たちの嘘と真実"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Documentary 